    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IEI301 · Chapter 2 · Session 7</span>\n<h2>Session 7 — 2.4 Buyer, importer, exporter, and supplier identification and due diligence</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14484 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IEI301 · Chương 2 · Buổi 7</span>\n<h2>Buổi 7 — 2.4 Buyer, importer, exporter, and supplier identification and due diligence</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14484 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline; PBL/RBL</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO7, CLO8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline; PBL/RBL</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO7, CLO8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>2.4 Buyer, importer, exporter, and supplier identification and due diligence<br>- Credibility, capacity, commercial fit, sanctions, and transaction red flags</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Seyoum (2022), Export–Import Theory, Practices, and Procedures, 4th ed.: Chapters 4, 5, 15 and 17; due-diligence scorecard</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Before class: collect evidence on one potential partner. In class: apply a due-diligence scorecard. After class: record unresolved risks and required verification.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CQ1 - Session 7</strong> — What evidence is sufficient to approve a buyer or supplier for a first transaction, and what evidence remains inconclusive?</li>\n<li><strong>CQ2 - Session 7</strong> — How should due diligence change when price attractiveness conflicts with credit, compliance, or performance risk?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
