    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IEI301 · Chapter 7 · Session 40</span>\n<h2>Session 40 — 7.7 Special credits and guarantees</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14484 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IEI301 · Chương 7 · Buổi 40</span>\n<h2>Buổi 40 — 7.7 Special credits and guarantees</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14484 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline; decision workshop</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline; decision workshop</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>7.7 Special credits and guarantees<br>- Transferable, back-to-back, revolving, red-clause, deferred-payment, standby L/C; bid and performance guarantees</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Seyoum (2022), Export–Import Theory, Practices, and Procedures, 4th ed.: Chapter 11; special-credit comparison worksheet</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Before class: review special instruments. In class: match instruments to transaction needs. After class: justify whether any special credit or guarantee is required.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CQ1 - Session 40</strong> — Which special credit or guarantee solves the assigned transaction need without creating a structurally inappropriate instrument?</li>\n<li><strong>CQ2 - Session 40</strong> — How do transferable credit, assignment of proceeds, and back-to-back credit allocate rights and risks differently?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
