    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IEI301 · Chapter 10 · Session 52</span>\n<h2>Session 52 — UNIT 10. TRADE REMEDIES, ALTERNATIVE TRANSACTIONS, AND COURSE INTEGRATION</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14484 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IEI301 · Chương 10 · Buổi 52</span>\n<h2>Buổi 52 — UNIT 10. TRADE REMEDIES, ALTERNATIVE TRANSACTIONS, AND COURSE INTEGRATION</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14484 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline; case-based</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I,T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline; case-based</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I,T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>UNIT 10. TRADE REMEDIES, ALTERNATIVE TRANSACTIONS, AND COURSE INTEGRATION<br>10.1 Anti-dumping, countervailing measures, and safeguards<br>- Core concepts, material injury, business exposure, and early-warning response</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Seyoum (2022), Export–Import Theory, Practices, and Procedures, 4th ed.: Chapter 19; WTO trade-remedies resources</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Before class: distinguish the three measures. In class: analyze a trade-remedy scenario. After class: prepare an early-warning and evidence-preservation plan.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CQ1 - Session 52</strong> — Is the assigned measure anti-dumping, countervailing, or safeguard action, and what business condition distinguishes it?</li>\n<li><strong>CQ2 - Session 52</strong> — What evidence should an exporter preserve before a trade-remedy investigation begins?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
