    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Sách, tài liệu theo syllabus.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IEI301 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IEI301 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Export–Import Theory, Practices, and Procedures</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Belay Seyoum · Routledge / Taylor &amp; Francis · 2022 · Fourth Edition</p><p>Core source for Units 1–10 and Appendices A–P.</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Incoterms® 2020</strong></p><p>International Chamber of Commerce · ICC · 2020 · 2020</p><p>Official ICC rules for the 11 trade terms. <a href=\"https://iccwbo.org/business-solutions/incoterms-rules/incoterms-2020/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://iccwbo.org/business-solutions/incoterms-rules/incoterms-2020/</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>United Nations Convention on Contracts for the International Sale of Goods (CISG)</strong></p><p>UNCITRAL · United Nations · 1980</p><p>Official convention text. <a href=\"https://uncitral.un.org/en/texts/salegoods/conventions/sale_of_goods/cisg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://uncitral.un.org/en/texts/salegoods/conventions/sale_of_goods/cisg</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Uniform Customs and Practice for Documentary Credits (UCP 600)</strong></p><p>International Chamber of Commerce · ICC · 2007 · ICC Publication No. 600</p><p>Official ICC documentary-credit rules and supporting guidance. <a href=\"https://library.iccwbo.org/content/tfb/RULES/tfb-ucp600-rules.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://library.iccwbo.org/content/tfb/RULES/tfb-ucp600-rules.htm</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Uniform Rules for Collections (URC 522)</strong></p><p>International Chamber of Commerce · ICC · 1995 · ICC Publication No. 522</p><p>Official ICC rules for documentary collections. <a href=\"https://2go.iccwbo.org/explore-our-products/ebooks/trade-finance/urc-522-uniform-rules-for-collections-config-1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://2go.iccwbo.org/explore-our-products/ebooks/trade-finance/urc-522-uniform-rules-for-collections-config-1.html</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>What is the Harmonized System (HS)?</strong></p><p>World Customs Organization · WCO</p><p>Official WCO overview of the HS. <a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/overview/what-is-the-harmonized-system.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/overview/what-is-the-harmonized-system.aspx</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Agreement on Implementation of Article VII of GATT 1994 (Customs Valuation Agreement)</strong></p><p>World Trade Organization · WTO · 1994</p><p>Official customs-valuation legal text. <a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/cv_e.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/cv_e.htm</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Viet Nam National Trade Repository (VNTR)</strong></p><p>Ministry of Industry and Trade of Viet Nam · MOIT</p><p>Official source for cross-border trade rules, procedures, forms, tariffs, and trade agreements in Viet Nam. <a href=\"https://vntr.moit.gov.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://vntr.moit.gov.vn/</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Vietnam Customs Portal</strong></p><p>Vietnam Customs · General Department of Vietnam Customs</p><p>Official customs information and procedural updates. <a href=\"https://www.customs.gov.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.customs.gov.vn/</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>WTO Trade Remedies Resources</strong></p><p>World Trade Organization · WTO</p><p>Official resources on anti-dumping, subsidies/countervailing measures, and safeguards. <a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/adp_e/adp_e.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/adp_e/adp_e.htm</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Intellectual Property for Business and International Trade</strong></p><p>World Intellectual Property Organization · WIPO</p><p>Official intellectual-property learning resources. <a href=\"https://www.wipo.int/about-ip/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.wipo.int/about-ip/en/</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>UNCITRAL Model Law on Electronic Commerce</strong></p><p>UNCITRAL · United Nations · 1996</p><p>Official model-law reference for electronic records and functional equivalence. <a href=\"https://uncitral.un.org/en/texts/ecommerce/modellaw/electronic_commerce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://uncitral.un.org/en/texts/ecommerce/modellaw/electronic_commerce</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>IEI301 Integrated Export–Import Transaction Project Brief</strong></p><p>IEI301 Course Team · Internal course material · Current course version</p><p>Lecturer-developed project brief, milestones, evidence requirements, report structure, and defence guidance.</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>IEI301 Costing, Contract, Logistics, Payment, Customs, and Document-Pack Worksheets</strong></p><p>IEI301 Course Team · Internal course material · Current course version</p><p>Lecturer-developed numerical, decision, drafting, and document-audit worksheets aligned with Units 2–10.</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>IEI301 Unit Slide Decks and Student Handouts</strong></p><p>IEI301 Course Team · Internal course material · Current course version</p><p>Unit-based slides, cases, diagrams, process maps, examples, activities, and student summaries.</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Selected official market-access, tariff, origin, customs, banking, carrier, and logistics sources</strong></p><p>Relevant competent authorities and professional institutions · Various official sources</p><p>Lecturer-approved current sources selected according to the product, country, route, and transaction case.</p></div>"
